The film received generally negative reviews from critics and is
considered to be one of the worst films ever made.

26
01:44:50,322 --> 01:44:56,322
The film's poor reception caused Warner Bros.

27
01:48:52,258 --> 01:48:58,258
to cancel future Batman films, including Schumacher's planned Batman Unchained.

28
