One of the songs recorded for the film, "The End Is the Beginning Is the End" by the Smashing
Pumpkins, won a Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance at the 40th Annual Grammy Awards.

29
01:56:56,129 --> 01:57:02,129
The film explores themes of dual identity, double
life, crime fighter, superhero, ice age.

